# Copy to .env in the project you're designing (never commit it) or export it in your shell.
#
# kie.ai API key. Only needed when craft generates imagery or video. Builds from your own
# photos and footage need no key. Get one at https://kie.ai
#
# Published rates at the time of writing: about 28 credits per still and 160 per 5-second
# clip. A six-section landing page with two clips lands around 520 credits.
KIE_AI_API_KEY=
